meta {
  name: Confirm Planned Payment
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/planned-payments/{{plannedPaymentId}}/confirm
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  # Confirm Planned Payment

  Manually confirms a planned payment, creating a transaction and advancing the next due date.

  - Creates a transaction with the planned payment details
  - Advances the nextDueDate to the next occurrence
  - If the planned payment reaches its occurrence limit, marks it as COMPLETED

  Replace {{plannedPaymentId}} with the actual UUID.

  Returns the created transaction.
}
